(30 mm sphere center measurement at the current B/C pose)
(Before running: manually set the rotary pose, jog to a safe Z above the sphere,)
(and jog so the probe is roughly over the sphere center in X/Y)
(This cycle does not change WCO and does not auto-index the rotaries)
(Custom sphere cycle; Probe Basic has no native sphere calibration workflow)
(Uses only basic Probe Basic setup values: probe tool, feeds, distances, and)
(calibration offset. Do not assume Probe Basic's pocket/boss setup maps directly)
(to sphere geometry.)
(Appends results to sphere-center-results.csv in the active config directory)

G21 G17 G40 G49 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G94

#<probe_tool_number> = #3014
#<calibration_offset> = #3032
#<max_z_distance> = #3020
#<max_xy_distance> = #3018
#<xy_clearance> = #3019
#<z_clearance> = #3021
#<step_off_width> = #3023
#<probe_slow_fr> = #3015
#<probe_fast_fr> = #3016
#<probe_traverse_fr> = #3017

o<10> if [#<probe_tool_number> LE 0]
  #<probe_tool_number> = #5400
o<10> endif
o<11> if [#<max_z_distance> LE 0]
  #<max_z_distance> = 25.0
o<11> endif
o<12> if [#<max_xy_distance> LE 0]
  #<max_xy_distance> = 30.0
o<12> endif
o<13> if [#<xy_clearance> LE 0]
  #<xy_clearance> = 2.0
o<13> endif
o<21> if [#<xy_clearance> GT 2.0]
  #<xy_clearance> = 2.0
o<21> endif
o<14> if [#<z_clearance> LE 0]
  #<z_clearance> = 2.0
o<14> endif
o<15> if [#<step_off_width> LE 0]
  #<step_off_width> = 8.0
o<15> endif
o<20> if [#<step_off_width> GT 8.0]
  #<step_off_width> = 8.0
o<20> endif
o<16> if [#<probe_slow_fr> LE 0]
  #<probe_slow_fr> = 50.0
o<16> endif
o<17> if [#<probe_fast_fr> LE 0]
  #<probe_fast_fr> = 100.0
o<17> endif
o<18> if [#<probe_traverse_fr> LE 0]
  #<probe_traverse_fr> = 300.0
o<18> endif
o<19> if [#<probe_traverse_fr> GT 300.0]
  #<probe_traverse_fr> = 300.0
o<19> endif

#<sphere_diameter> = 30.0

#<x_hint> = #<_x>
#<y_hint> = #<_y>

#100 = #<probe_tool_number>
#101 = #<sphere_diameter>
#102 = #<calibration_offset>
#103 = #<max_z_distance>
#104 = #<max_xy_distance>
#105 = #<xy_clearance>
#106 = #<z_clearance>
#107 = #<step_off_width>
#108 = #<probe_slow_fr>
#109 = #<probe_fast_fr>
#110 = #<x_hint>
#111 = #<y_hint>
#112 = #<probe_traverse_fr>

(DEBUG, SPHERE_MEASURE_30MM start pose_abs_b=#<_abs_b> pose_abs_c=#<_abs_c> x_hint=#<x_hint> y_hint=#<y_hint>)
(LOGAPPEND,sphere-center-results.csv)
o<probe_sphere_center> call [#100] [#101] [#102] [#103] [#104] [#105] [#106] [#107] [#108] [#109] [#110] [#111] [#112]
(LOGCLOSE)
(DEBUG, SPHERE_MEASURE_30MM complete - copy SPHERE_RESULT lines into the calibration log)

M2
